    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720270/extras/0b5aef640a23db27eac309a304f0b732.avif?t=1702886644\" width=616 height=255 /></span><br><br><strong>About VFurrika!</strong><br>VFurrika! is an addictive puzzle game that combines the charm of your favourite VFur streamers with strategic gameplay.<br>Drop your favorite furry VTuber into a glass and witness them merging into other VTubers upon contact!<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>The game is simple: Aim and drop randomly-generated VTubers heads into a glass.<br><br>Have 2 of the same heads touch each other for them to merge into a bigger head of another type.<br>This kind of gameplay allows combos to be made, but only if you\u2019ve got skills!<br><br>Once the glass is filled to the brim, the game is over, but you can upload your score to the Leaderboards. Try beating your friends\u2019 scores!<br><br><u>Features:</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Leaderboards<br></li><li>Addictive Gameplay<br></li><li>Recognizable Faces<br></li><li>Cute Visuals</li></ul>",
